From: Ada <ada@6bit.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:01:54 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] P9: agent keys open the resident chat and the approval card
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

SUPER+SHIFT+CTRL+A was omarchy-agent --pick (the human's own harness); it
now toggles omanix.chat. SUPER+ALT+A opens omanix.approval. SUPER+A is NOT
rebound: at v4.5.0-rc2 it is upstream's "Select all" in clipboard.lua, so
U25 ("unbound") does not hold; moving chat there is a design decision
(DESIGN §h.5.4).
---
 default/hypr/bindings/utilities.lua | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/default/hypr/bindings/utilities.lua b/default/hypr/bindings/utilities.lua
index 4f00ca8..6aad6fe 100644
--- a/default/hypr/bindings/utilities.lua
+++ b/default/hypr/bindings/utilities.lua
@@ -97,7 +97,10 @@ o.bind("SUPER + CTRL + ALT + T", "Show time", "omarchy-notification-time")
 o.bind("SUPER + CTRL + ALT + B", "Show battery remaining", "omarchy-notification-battery")
 o.bind("SUPER + CTRL + ALT + W", "Toggle weather", "omarchy-notification-weather")
 
-o.bind("SUPER + SHIFT + CTRL + A", "Agent", "omarchy-agent --pick")
+-- omanix: the agent keys open the resident's chat and the approval card
+-- (DESIGN §h.5.4). SUPER + A stays upstream's "Select all" (clipboard.lua).
+o.bind("SUPER + SHIFT + CTRL + A", "Agent chat", "omarchy-shell omanix.chat toggle")
+o.bind("SUPER + ALT + A", "Approvals", "omarchy-shell omanix.approval open")
 o.bind("SUPER + CTRL + A", "Audio", { panel = "omarchy.audio" })
 o.bind("SUPER + CTRL + B", "Bluetooth", { panel = "omarchy.bluetooth" })
 o.bind("SUPER + CTRL + D", "Display", { panel = "omarchy.monitor" })
